<title>UK: Philippines sets $500 mln in 30-, 100-year bonds.</title>
<headline>Philippines sets $500 mln in 30-, 100-year bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines has launched a $500 million Yankee bond in two tranches, one $400 million 30-year tranche and a $100 million 100-year tranche, lead manager Salomon Brothers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    $400 MLN	COUPON     8.60	MATURITY    15.JUN.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.908    PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  BA1/BB+   REOFFER    99.908    SPREAD	+184.9 BP</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     8.60	MATURITY</p>
<p>15.JUN.2097</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.459    PAY DATE</p>
<p>24.JUN.1997</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  BA1/BB+   REOFFER    98.459    SPREAD	+197.5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
